<text text-anchor="middle" x="2223.5" y="-318.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;202: Pulses with a width smaller</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2223.5" y="-303.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">than the configured debouncing minimum</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2223.5" y="-288.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">time MUST be ignored by the speed</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2223.5" y="-273.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">counter. </text>
</g>
