<title>AST&#45;205</title>
<polygon fill="none" stroke="black" points="2950,-356.5 2673,-356.5 2673,-243.5 2950,-243.5 2950,-356.5"/>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-341.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;205: The firmware MUST configure</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-326.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">the Memory Protection Unit (MPU)</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-311.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">to enforce read&#45;only access to the</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-296.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">sensor driver code and restricted</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-281.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">read/write access to its data structures,</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-266.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">triggering a fault on unauthorized</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="2811.5" y="-251.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">access. </text>
</g>
