<title>AST&#45;302</title>
<polygon fill="none" stroke="black" points="3600.5,-349 3342.5,-349 3342.5,-251 3600.5,-251 3600.5,-349"/>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-333.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;302: Concurrent tasks accessing</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-318.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">shared speed data are synchronized</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-303.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">using RTOS &#160;&#160;primitives such that</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-288.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">no data races, partial writes, or</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-273.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">inconsistent reads &#160;&#160;occur during</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3471.5" y="-258.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">execution. </text>
</g>
