<text text-anchor="middle" x="7298.5" y="-326.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;303: The system detects queue</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="7298.5" y="-311.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">overflows and lost messages in inter&#45;task</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="7298.5" y="-296.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00"> &#160;communication and reports these</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="7298.5" y="-281.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">events through logs or diagnostic</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="7298.5" y="-266.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">counters &#160;&#160;at runtime. </text>
</g>
