<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-333.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;304: The RTOS configuration prevents</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-318.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">unbounded priority inversion by ensuring</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-303.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">that &#160;&#160;safety&#45;critical tasks are</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-288.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">protected by priority inheritance</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-273.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">or equivalent &#160;&#160;mechanisms, maintaining</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="3825.5" y="-258.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">bounded execution latency. </text>
</g>
