<text text-anchor="middle" x="4480.5" y="-281.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">or less than the min of the range</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="4480.5" y="-266.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">it must be discarded. </text>
