<text text-anchor="middle" x="5482.5" y="-318.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;502: The instrument cluster shall</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="5482.5" y="-303.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">detect and flag any vehicle parameter</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="5482.5" y="-288.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">that is not updated within the defined</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="5482.5" y="-273.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">freshness time limit (300ms). </text>
</g>
