<text text-anchor="middle" x="5769.5" y="-296.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">behavior when receiving invalid,</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="5769.5" y="-281.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">missing, or out&#45;of&#45;range vehicle</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="5769.5" y="-266.3" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">data. </text>
