<text text-anchor="middle" x="8189.5" y="-318.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">AST&#45;602: If for any reason the auto&#45;start</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8189.5" y="-303.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">of an application fails, the system</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8189.5" y="-288.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">should attempt to run it again at</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8189.5" y="-273.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">least 10 more times. </text>
</g>
