<text text-anchor="middle" x="8895.5" y="-497.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">EXP&#45;602: The AGL system on Raspberry</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8895.5" y="-482.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">Pi continuously monitors key parameters</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8895.5" y="-467.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">such as temperature and voltage to</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8895.5" y="-452.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">prevent abrupt shutdowns and protect</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="8895.5" y="-437.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">the file system from corruption.</text>
</g>
