<text text-anchor="middle" x="9300.5" y="-497.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">EXP&#45;700: The instrument cluster shall</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9300.5" y="-482.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">be be updated at appropriate times</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9300.5" y="-467.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">and in a security way, ensuring the</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9300.5" y="-452.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">integrity of the data displayed in</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9300.5" y="-437.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">the vehicle. </text>
</g>
