<text text-anchor="middle" x="9964.5" y="-497.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">EXP&#45;701: All over&#45;the&#45;air (OTA) updates</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9964.5" y="-482.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">are performed securely, ensuring</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9964.5" y="-467.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">data integrity and preventing any</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9964.5" y="-452.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">corruption or tampering that could</text>
<text text-anchor="middle" x="9964.5" y="-437.8" font-family="Open Sans" font-size="14.00">affect system functionality. </text>
</g>
